    "title": "7e8e5418cbad",
    "description": "048595ca89f9",
    "tags": "f7ad83b68a5b",
    "thumbnail": "f8ea37736989"
  },
  "lines": {
    "p001": {
      "source_hash": "b7172e801960",
      "text": "Chief! It's so hot!"
    },
    "p002": {
      "source_hash": "3f5b61642553",
      "text": "I open the fridge,"
    },
    "p003": {
      "source_hash": "168c59f250fe",
      "text": "my face feels cool!"
    },
    "p004": {
      "source_hash": "7bf79f51a091",
      "text": "Great idea!"
    },
    "p005": {
      "source_hash": "8b23cc53bc02",
      "text": "Leave it open,"
    },
    "p006": {
      "source_hash": "ec357ef013f5",
      "text": "and no AC in the kitchen!"
    },
    "p007": {
      "source_hash": "8395747e3950",
      "text": "Wait, don't unplug!"
    },
    "p008": {
      "source_hash": "c88a1c380fdb",
      "text": "Guess: fridge door open all day,"
    },
    "p009": {
      "source_hash": "7667289aae3d",
      "text": "kitchen gets cooler, or warmer?"
    },
    "p010": {
      "source_hash": "002e57b4aaa5",
      "text": "Warmer?"
    },
    "p011": {
      "source_hash": "d5d7f4e1f933",
      "text": "But the fridge is cold!"
    },
    "p012": {
      "source_hash": "8a877c6d664c",
      "text": "Next time, hold your hand near its back."
    },
    "p013": {
      "source_hash": "5fad15bf2f6d",
      "text": "It doesn't feel cold at all."
    },
    "p014": {
      "source_hash": "0b087fdc1ec2",
      "text": "Behind it,"
    },
    "p015": {
      "source_hash": "e87865d778ae",
      "text": "what's hiding?"
    },
    "p016": {
      "source_hash": "915a9848b82a",
      "text": "And that humming box on your balcony,"
    },
    "p017": {
      "source_hash": "d5da43348a89",
      "text": "does it blow cold air, or hot?"
    },
    "p018": {
      "source_hash": "64872e30b282",
      "text": "The AC?"
    },
    "p019": {
      "source_hash": "7ec9f7b51336",
      "text": "Cold air, for sure?"
    },
    "p020": {
      "source_hash": "aee671c7ac12",
      "text": "All the answers hide in one fridge."
    },
    "p021": {
      "source_hash": "d329b4aea270",
      "text": "With its door open, where does the heat go?"
    },
    "p022": {
      "source_hash": "f1fbe5370dca",
      "text": "It's full of cold,"
    },
    "p023": {
      "source_hash": "db519e542b90",
      "text": "open the door, cold comes out!"
    },
    "p024": {
      "source_hash": "8c8d0ac2f508",
      "text": "Ever let hot tea cool down?"
    },
    "p025": {
      "source_hash": "70f485a4b48d",
      "text": "Left on the table, what happens?"
    },
    "p026": {
      "source_hash": "a1db32b61f99",
      "text": "It gets warm."
    },
    "p027": {
      "source_hash": "c1f7b9777c52",
      "text": "Heat left!"
    },
    "p028": {
      "source_hash": "2561d58ec95e",
      "text": "And an ice cube?"
    },
    "p029": {
      "source_hash": "29949618a983",
      "text": "It slowly melts."
    },
    "p030": {
      "source_hash": "39f36455444d",
      "text": "It melts because heat from the air goes in."
    },
    "p031": {
      "source_hash": "225d245b624a",
      "text": "On its own, heat only goes from hot places to cold."
    },
    "p032": {
      "source_hash": "61e8dce75fb3",
      "text": "And cold?"
    },
    "p033": {
      "source_hash": "7072e93bbb8b",
      "text": "Doesn't cold air move by itself?"
    },
    "p034": {
      "source_hash": "d93c5aab02b6",
      "text": "What we call cold is less heat."
    },
    "p035": {
      "source_hash": "034b4877b852",
      "text": "Cold isn't a thing that leaks out."
    },
    "p036": {
      "source_hash": "efca9195884d",
      "text": "Then my face,"
    },
    "p037": {
      "source_hash": "a1d48a27d2ed",
      "text": "why did it feel cool?"
    },
    "p038": {
      "source_hash": "70e3b42cdb9f",
      "text": "Cold air flows out and touches your face,"
    },
    "p039": {
      "source_hash": "95fd93cf0b40",
      "text": "and your face's heat goes into that air."
    },
    "p040": {
      "source_hash": "0bb13789f451",
      "text": "My heat got stolen!"
    },
    "p041": {
      "source_hash": "b6d74c1d6dcf",
      "text": "To track heat, draw a circle."
    },
    "p042": {
      "source_hash": "8094f53d46b8",
      "text": "Heat in the circle, more or less, we write it all down."
    },
    "p043": {
      "source_hash": "7f741889678a",
      "text": "I'll draw heat as red balls."
    },
    "p044": {
      "source_hash": "aa7814faf297",
      "text": "First, circle just the inside."
    },
    "p045": {
      "source_hash": "f40432e0831b",
      "text": "The shelves are only 3 to 5 degrees,"
    },
    "p046": {
      "source_hash": "1635dcd9825b",
      "text": "way colder than a summer kitchen."
    },
    "p047": {
      "source_hash": "c88b1e8516c1",
      "text": "The freezer? How cold?"
    },
    "p048": {
      "source_hash": "0e6fe5844c83",
      "text": "Usually minus 18 degrees, or even colder."
    },
    "p049": {
      "source_hash": "2c4f1b1915af",
      "text": "Minus 18!"
    },
    "p050": {
      "source_hash": "e4562096a5cd",
      "text": "Way colder than winter in Taiwan!"
    },
    "p051": {
      "source_hash": "d5d8dd87011b",
      "text": "The bigger the gap, the harder heat pushes in."
    },
    "p052": {
      "source_hash": "69606f40df49",
      "text": "Kitchen heat"
    },
    "p053": {
      "source_hash": "e8044ff9c033",
      "text": "wants into the fridge?"
    },
    "p054": {
      "source_hash": "84858753c1b7",
      "text": "Yes. By that rule, heat always heads for cold."
    },
    "p055": {
      "source_hash": "0c159cbff7e5",
      "text": "But the fridge door gets in its way."
    },
    "p056": {
      "source_hash": "399cfe6588f9",
      "text": "Open it. Feel the edge."
    },
    "p057": {
      "source_hash": "5a88375b6bd5",
      "text": "Thick, heavy, with a soft rubber strip round it."
    },
    "p058": {
      "source_hash": "e08d08650ed0",
      "text": "Thick like a flask!"
    },
    "p059": {
      "source_hash": "185271b7781d",
      "text": "Yes. Door and walls hold insulation."
    },
    "p060": {
      "source_hash": "59b39972f5f2",
      "text": "It's insulation: heat gets in slower."
    },
    "p061": {
      "source_hash": "796ec4046f41",
      "text": "Remember this thick door. It'll be back."
    },
    "p062": {
      "source_hash": "bd96aec42c6c",
      "text": "Just slower?"
    },
    "p063": {
      "source_hash": "13f4d5f3db90",
      "text": "So heat sneaks in?"
    },
    "p064": {
      "source_hash": "3b92cd9d7d93",
      "text": "Yes. Yet it stays cold,"
    },
    "p065": {
      "source_hash": "57ef5c8a1fbc",
      "text": "so something keeps moving heat out."
    },
    "p066": {
      "source_hash": "a0c91d1c24f5",
      "text": "Heat in the circle goes out, ball by ball."
    },
    "p067": {
      "source_hash": "47283fea74d1",
      "text": "Heat?"
    },
    "p068": {
      "source_hash": "41ee68987691",
      "text": "where did it go?"
    },
    "p069": {
      "source_hash": "be11f6a5a898",
      "text": "Maybe the fridge"
    },
    "p070": {
      "source_hash": "0cec453a5dc3",
      "text": "ate the heat?"
    },
    "p071": {
      "source_hash": "7becdf761571",
      "text": "Heat never vanishes. It just moves."
    },
    "p072": {
      "source_hash": "5ef3679c80b5",
      "text": "Not sure? Go round the back."
    },
    "p073": {
      "source_hash": "6f0e9e8688bc",
      "text": "Huh? It's warm!"
    },
    "p074": {
      "source_hash": "73d24cbaae95",
      "text": "A warm breeze!"
    },
    "p075": {
      "source_hash": "a49f26eea7ea",
      "text": "Just bring your hand close. There are wires."
    },
    "p076": {
      "source_hash": "462c50c43919",
      "text": "These curvy pipes at the back feel warm."
    },
    "p077": {
      "source_hash": "380e8fd1a016",
      "text": "The heat that left the inside comes out here."
    },
    "p078": {
      "source_hash": "e95a80445e89",
      "text": "The heat went to the back!"
    },
    "p079": {
      "source_hash": "9bce21fe93ad",
      "text": "Some fridges blow warm air from below,"
    },
    "p080": {
      "source_hash": "15ffc9f633b5",
      "text": "Stand in front. Ever felt it on your feet?"
    },
    "p081": {
      "source_hash": "d8391d830a0b",
      "text": "Warm feet,"
    },
    "p082": {
      "source_hash": "34ab9467f167",
      "text": "cool face!"
    },
    "p083": {
      "source_hash": "ee2e6d9cc774",
      "text": "But a fridge has no hands."
    },
    "p084": {
      "source_hash": "d152ca25322f",
      "text": "How does it move heat?"
    },
    "p085": {
      "source_hash": "0751b621f960",
      "text": "In its pipes, something runs in a loop."
    },
    "p086": {
      "source_hash": "33f41bdbb110",
      "text": "It's called refrigerant."
    },
    "p087": {
      "source_hash": "1bc9f4cd28e1",
      "text": "Huh?"
    },
    "p088": {
      "source_hash": "ff6c7307a4e7",
      "text": "Is it cold itself?"
    },
    "p089": {
      "source_hash": "572d772e9217",
      "text": "Not always, but it changes. After a hot bath,"
    },
    "p090": {
      "source_hash": "2a481522d9d1",
      "text": "when you step out wet, do you shiver?"
    },
    "p091": {
      "source_hash": "83ec21889dbc",
      "text": "Yes! The water was hot!"
    },
    "p092": {
      "source_hash": "0e3109c97ff4",
      "text": "When the water on you turns into vapor,"
    },
    "p093": {
      "source_hash": "205b3b934b24",
      "text": "it takes your heat with it."
    },
    "p094": {
      "source_hash": "ba6b32042453",
      "text": "So wet means cold!"
    },
    "p095": {
      "source_hash": "b68f95bdbd47",
      "text": "In the fridge, refrigerant turns from liquid to gas,"
    },
    "p096": {
      "source_hash": "2964963c1cc3",
      "text": "carrying the heat inside into the pipes."
    },
    "p097": {
      "source_hash": "d88e32ea3e04",
      "text": "It's so cold,"
    },
    "p098": {
      "source_hash": "766d0cb1f76c",
      "text": "and it can still turn to gas?"
    },
    "p099": {
      "source_hash": "8cd725bde610",
      "text": "Yes. It's a special liquid that boils easily,"
    },
    "p100": {
      "source_hash": "65e692591700",
      "text": "so a little heat in the fridge is enough."
    },
    "p101": {
      "source_hash": "42846c9e49a7",
      "text": "Boiling, but cold?"
    },
    "p102": {
      "source_hash": "bb4a69618061",
      "text": "What a weird liquid!"
    },
    "p103": {
      "source_hash": "7518a2b18c99",
      "text": "The hot gas,"
    },
    "p104": {
      "source_hash": "9eb4faf4c902",
      "text": "where next?"
    },
    "p105": {
      "source_hash": "e48936cab7ce",
      "text": "Into a round metal can."
    },
    "p106": {
      "source_hash": "28f428d21fb9",
      "text": "That can is the compressor."
    },
    "p107": {
      "source_hash": "c7d417713f75",
      "text": "It squeezes the gas tight."
    },
    "p108": {
      "source_hash": "3e9aa7d87bce",
      "text": "The squeezed refrigerant flows into the back pipes,"
    },
    "p109": {
      "source_hash": "bbff0f0a54f8",
      "text": "turns liquid, giving heat to the kitchen."
    },
    "p110": {
      "source_hash": "77a975998970",
      "text": "Then it flows back inside and goes round again."
    },
    "p111": {
      "source_hash": "63db4baa6c9b",
      "text": "A little train carrying heat!"
    },
    "p112": {
      "source_hash": "7baf69c37ec5",
      "text": "Pretty much. Round and round, carrying heat from in to out."
    },
    "p113": {
      "source_hash": "7e942b397d8b",
      "text": "Who pushes the train?"
    },
    "p114": {
      "source_hash": "12652fd29511",
      "text": "Electricity does. Squeezing gas is hard work,"
    },
    "p115": {
      "source_hash": "be8011a3125a",
      "text": "so the compressor keeps using power."
    },
    "p116": {
      "source_hash": "049788cf513e",
      "text": "We'll draw electricity as a yellow bolt."
    },
    "p117": {
      "source_hash": "24ab05860f20",
      "text": "It's not nonstop. When it warms, it starts,"
    },
    "p118": {
      "source_hash": "e55082a0f762",
      "text": "when cold, it rests."
    },
    "p119": {
      "source_hash": "55d81ae16193",
      "text": "That's why it's quiet sometimes!"
    },
    "p120": {
      "source_hash": "d3da14b332db",
      "text": "The power it uses,"
    },
    "p121": {
      "source_hash": "f2ab77da9298",
      "text": "where does it end up?"
    },
    "p122": {
      "source_hash": "73b7521ec063",
      "text": "And the heat at the back,"
    },
    "p123": {
      "source_hash": "e4f1584f39bf",
      "text": "and from inside"
    },
    "p124": {
      "source_hash": "75df1cd5c7e7",
      "text": "are they equal?"
    },
    "p125": {
      "source_hash": "f2255ae9f464",
      "text": "To answer, draw a bigger circle,"
    },
    "p126": {
      "source_hash": "7d4bf8b2e882",
      "text": "around the whole kitchen."
    },
    "p127": {
      "source_hash": "aa50778a6617",
      "text": "The fridge, its back, where you stand,"
    },
    "p128": {
      "source_hash": "71e36c86143b",
      "text": "are all in one circle now."
    },
    "p129": {
      "source_hash": "3b7d5d97c732",
      "text": "Door shut. Let's use easy numbers:"
    },
    "p130": {
      "source_hash": "43ca28d04bce",
      "text": "the fridge moves out two balls of heat,"
    },
    "p131": {
      "source_hash": "cd9ee06bf0f3",
      "text": "and the compressor uses one bolt."
    },
    "p132": {
      "source_hash": "1a9aba9a876d",
      "text": "How many out the back?"
    },
    "p133": {
      "source_hash": "62a7c0ee0d48",
      "text": "Three. The two moved out, plus one."
    },
    "p134": {
      "source_hash": "80fd1b3727a5",
      "text": "That one comes from the compressor's power."
    },
    "p135": {
      "source_hash": "26ae01210cdc",
      "text": "More comes out than was moved out!"
    },
    "p136": {
      "source_hash": "e760c2879753",
      "text": "Yes. Used power doesn't vanish. It ends up as heat."
    },
    "p137": {
      "source_hash": "a5c13336517a",
      "text": "Door shut, does the kitchen warm up?"
    },
    "p138": {
      "source_hash": "e98d5b7e0889",
      "text": "Those two balls sneaked in slowly through walls and door."
    },
    "p139": {
      "source_hash": "ede7b25ad758",
      "text": "Now they're back, plus one from power."
    },
    "p140": {
      "source_hash": "36f06a827477",
      "text": "So even with it shut,"
    },
    "p141": {
      "source_hash": "3254249642e1",
      "text": "the kitchen warms a bit?"
    },
    "p142": {
      "source_hash": "f76687cf1119",
      "text": "Yes. While the fridge runs, it warms the kitchen a little."
    },
    "p143": {
      "source_hash": "005ebd05fb40",
      "text": "If I open it,"
    },
    "p144": {
      "source_hash": "0e34bb8e2063",
      "text": "then what?"
    },
    "p145": {
      "source_hash": "625dc61639d1",
      "text": "Kitchen heat pours in the door,"
    },
    "p146": {
      "source_hash": "e4c425ec5331",
      "text": "and goes out the back, to the kitchen."
    },
    "p147": {
      "source_hash": "2ddd2f1d3e23",
      "text": "Heat goes in circles!"
    },
    "p148": {
      "source_hash": "98bf9e64094d",
      "text": "Yes. The two it moved out run back in."
    },
    "p149": {
      "source_hash": "993448b744d4",
      "text": "The kitchen doesn't lose a single one."
    },
    "p150": {
      "source_hash": "e25151dec489",
      "text": "But each loop, the bolt"
    },
    "p151": {
      "source_hash": "b941f4490e4d",
      "text": "adds one more ball of heat."
    },
    "p152": {
      "source_hash": "5d4a730599d5",
      "text": "So with the door open,"
    },
    "p153": {
      "source_hash": "defd13d28935",
      "text": "the kitchen gets warmer!"
    },
    "p154": {
      "source_hash": "034e0dbc348d",
      "text": "But at the door,"
    },
    "p155": {
      "source_hash": "5b6396465b28",
      "text": "it really is cool!"
    },
    "p156": {
      "source_hash": "3677bf0254a1",
      "text": "True. Right at the door, it's cooler."
    },
    "p157": {
      "source_hash": "01bf3f39f165",
      "text": "But walk away, and that cool spot isn't yours."
    },
    "p158": {
      "source_hash": "f77e16007326",
      "text": "Open, the inside keeps warming,"
    },
    "p159": {
      "source_hash": "382ef4689927",
      "text": "so the compressor can't stop using power."
    },
    "p160": {
      "source_hash": "1e062ea5c74d",
      "text": "Poor tired fridge!"
    },
    "p161": {
      "source_hash": "c9604ed3360d",
      "text": "Your power meter too,"
    },
    "p162": {
      "source_hash": "70427cb4f5c3",
      "text": "and the bill goes up."
    },
    "p163": {
      "source_hash": "d86a30ddd6a2",
      "text": "A fridge with its door open"
    },
    "p164": {
      "source_hash": "4531a6e99a75",
      "text": "is like a winter heater?"
    },
    "p165": {
      "source_hash": "c9d31a47be23",
      "text": "Yes. Just the long way,"
    },
    "p166": {
      "source_hash": "7fe1c5c54c52",
      "text": "and warms the food inside too."
    },
    "p167": {
      "source_hash": "049670cdb014",
      "text": "The fridge's big trick:"
    },
    "p168": {
      "source_hash": "aa856c62028b",
      "text": "it moves heat. It doesn't make cold."
    },
    "p169": {
      "source_hash": "b2de70b627aa",
      "text": "It fooled me!"
    },
    "p170": {
      "source_hash": "5a19c061ddb5",
      "text": "And the AC?"
    },
    "p171": {
      "source_hash": "10f181af712d",
      "text": "Does the AC move heat too?"
    },
    "p172": {
      "source_hash": "6624f41099c1",
      "text": "Yes. They're the same kind of machine."
    },
    "p173": {
      "source_hash": "a658a955447e",
      "text": "Refrigerant, compressor, and it uses power."
    },
    "p174": {
      "source_hash": "7f477276f4db",
      "text": "So with AC on,"
    },
    "p175": {
      "source_hash": "be545d00643f",
      "text": "how does the room get cool?"
    },
    "p176": {
      "source_hash": "35fec431bc49",
      "text": "The answer's on the balcony. Let's go look."
    },
    "p177": {
      "source_hash": "b60f6fc856c9",
      "text": "Wow, it's blowing hot air!"
    },
    "p178": {
      "source_hash": "31bccbba51df",
      "text": "This is the outdoor unit. Its heat"
    },
    "p179": {
      "source_hash": "d61869418d48",
      "text": "was moved out of your room."
    },
    "p180": {
      "source_hash": "91805969a0d7",
      "text": "I know! It takes outside air,"
    },
    "p181": {
      "source_hash": "64f138e91c2f",
      "text": "cools it and blows it in!"
    },
    "p182": {
      "source_hash": "56b7cf461036",
      "text": "Lots of people think so. But the AC blows"
    },
    "p183": {
      "source_hash": "ce5381ed2aa4",
      "text": "your room's own air."
    },
    "p184": {
      "source_hash": "810fd8c0bc0c",
      "text": "The wall unit sucks air in, takes heat, blows it back."
    },
    "p185": {
      "source_hash": "ac94aeb4fba7",
      "text": "It's joined to the balcony one by two pipes."
    },
    "p186": {
      "source_hash": "075b90beeb23",
      "text": "Refrigerant loops between,"
    },
    "p187": {
      "source_hash": "64eab5ac35ab",
      "text": "sound like the fridge?"
    },
    "p188": {
      "source_hash": "3883049c7a1b",
      "text": "The heat train!"
    },
    "p189": {
      "source_hash": "87514029d25a",
      "text": "Now circle your room: the room is the fridge's inside,"
    },
    "p190": {
      "source_hash": "ffd8c07723e8",
      "text": "and the fridge's back goes outside."
    },
    "p191": {
      "source_hash": "f90421ab5108",
      "text": "The hot end is outside!"
    },
    "p192": {
      "source_hash": "27057a6795ea",
      "text": "This time the heat goes outside and doesn't loop back,"
    },
    "p193": {
      "source_hash": "d9285d4e57a2",
      "text": "so the heat in the circle really goes down."
    },
    "p194": {
      "source_hash": "e76e131ecec3",
      "text": "Most of its power becomes heat,"
    },
    "p195": {
      "source_hash": "4dc752fb85cc",
      "text": "and goes out the outdoor unit."
    },
    "p196": {
      "source_hash": "d93a2caeb0d2",
      "text": "A normal AC, 1 bolt,"
    },
    "p197": {
      "source_hash": "b70d841e99c1",
      "text": "moves several balls of heat."
    },
    "p198": {
      "source_hash": "78a9bba627ff",
      "text": "One bolt moves several balls?"
    },
    "p199": {
      "source_hash": "adf8f49190f8",
      "text": "That's a lot!"
    },
    "p200": {
      "source_hash": "c5fcf3400156",
      "text": "It depends on the AC and weather."
    },
    "p201": {
      "source_hash": "9f4e09e91cfb",
      "text": "The hotter outside, the harder."
    },
    "p202": {
      "source_hash": "f4a3e7b259f0",
      "text": "Recall the thick door?"
    },
    "p203": {
      "source_hash": "4f7f8bd66f25",
      "text": "With the AC on, you shut windows, close curtains,"
    },
    "p204": {
      "source_hash": "22c0e9cfa253",
      "text": "a thick door for it."
    },
    "p205": {
      "source_hash": "250d80e40dd7",
      "text": "So that's why we shut windows!"
    },
    "p206": {
      "source_hash": "710940f0c9b4",
      "text": "The AC moves heat out,"
    },
    "p207": {
      "source_hash": "2698a5ea6c80",
      "text": "insulation keeps outside heat from sneaking back fast."
    },
    "p208": {
      "source_hash": "b809024d9aaa",
      "text": "One moves, one blocks!"
    },
    "p209": {
      "source_hash": "049df23e51ff",
      "text": "AC on, windows open?"
    },
    "p210": {
      "source_hash": "d218ae468eaf",
      "text": "Like an open fridge door. It works nonstop."
    },
    "p211": {
      "source_hash": "dfd9872abf53",
      "text": "An AC room is"
    },
    "p212": {
      "source_hash": "0eee606120bc",
      "text": "a big fridge!"
    },
    "p213": {
      "source_hash": "1a0fa704cc26",
      "text": "Yes, and you live inside the fridge."
    },
    "p214": {
      "source_hash": "f4168efd0a7f",
      "text": "OK, back to the kitchen. The door's still open."
    },
    "p215": {
      "source_hash": "859f7800a50c",
      "text": "Remember my idea?"
    },
    "p216": {
      "source_hash": "1c7ea3d3eb29",
      "text": "I take it back!"
    },
    "p217": {
      "source_hash": "bf6960fa08f3",
      "text": "Door open, the hot end"
    },
    "p218": {
      "source_hash": "137add139f63",
      "text": "stays in the kitchen!"
    },
    "p219": {
      "source_hash": "5dcc24284233",
      "text": "Fridge and AC: same machine, remember?"
    },
    "p220": {
      "source_hash": "7c70e3a0475c",
      "text": "The difference: hot end in the circle or out?"
    },
    "p221": {
      "source_hash": "b1068e783445",
      "text": "Next time, feel its back:"
    },
    "p222": {
      "source_hash": "fdbb4a8a9698",
      "text": "remember those three red balls? That warmth you feel is them."
    },
    "p223": {
      "source_hash": "36d742bcb996",
      "text": "So that's why!"
    },
    "p224": {
      "source_hash": "b997a16cd350",
      "text": "Where is your AC unit?"
    },
    "p225": {
      "source_hash": "a7d234c4eb2e",
      "text": "How hot is its air? Tell us below."
    },
    "p226": {
      "source_hash": "88de677d4daa",
      "text": "Find life's everyday whys with us. Subscribe to So That's Why."
    }
  }
}
